cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MLvs in published work, please cite the paper below."
title: "MLvs: machine learning based virtual screening"
abstract: >-
  Ligand-based virtual screening toolkit in which the classifier set, molecular
  representation, and consensus method are all user-selectable. Trains any
  combination of classical, ensemble, and deep learning models under a common
  cross-validation protocol, compares them, and ranks a compound library by
  their consensus. Developed for the DPP-4 natural product screen reported in
  Ali et al., Int. J. Mol. Sci. 2026.
